Foxpit includes or builds on these projects:

Magpie (https://github.com/yetone/magpie), MIT License, Copyright (c) yetone.
The installers ship the Magpie command-line app unchanged, in the version named
in MAGPIE_VERSION, checked against its published SHA256SUMS.

Traycer (https://github.com/traycerai/traycer), MIT License, Copyright (c) Traycer.
The device sizes in the browser's size menu (browser_tools.go, frontend/app.js)
come from Traycer's viewport toolbar.

Wails (https://github.com/wailsapp/wails), MIT License.
coder/websocket (https://github.com/coder/websocket), ISC License.
go-pty (https://github.com/aymanbagabas/go-pty), MIT License.
golang.org/x/sys, BSD 3-Clause License.
xterm.js (https://github.com/xtermjs/xterm.js), MIT License: frontend/vendor/xterm.
Inter (https://rsms.me/inter/), SIL Open Font License 1.1: frontend/vendor/inter.
T3 Code (https://github.com/pingdotgg/t3code), MIT License: the reading style of replies
(type, sizes, the fade of a new block while a reply streams) and the model picker's layout follow it.
